cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the unpublished manuscript using the preferred citation."
title: "Leaf deletion can move the unique mode of a tree domination polynomial by two"
authors:
  - family-names: Goyal
    given-names: Dev D.
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An explicit tree on 7284 vertices has a unimodal ordinary domination polynomial
  with unique mode 3978. Deleting a specified leaf gives a tree on 7283 vertices
  whose ordinary domination polynomial is unimodal with unique mode 3976.
  Exact integer coefficient certificates and a Lean formalization establish
  the result. Historical novelty remains provisional.
preferred-citation:
